  "id": "adjustment",
  "term": "adjustment",
  "definition": "Adjustment is the later process of revising one’s understanding and responses after recognizing that earlier information or beliefs may be inaccurate. In this study, it is described as a flexible, non-fixed pattern shaped by cognitive, emotional, and social influences, along with developing self-efficacy and self-regulation.",
